Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.11,0:00:10.17,TL,,0,0,0,,捧杯之前 他先要赢的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.17,0:00:12.17,TL,,0,0,0,,是一张入场券
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.01,0:00:15.58,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年 他离世界前{\fs78}100{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.58,0:00:17.44,TL,,0,0,0,,只差{\fs78}30{\fs68}个积分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:20.27,TL,,0,0,0,,右肩伤 却让他停赛半年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:22.64,TL,,0,0,0,,第二年 排名跌到{\fs78}267{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:25.27,TL,,0,0,0,,温网资格赛又摔伤退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.11,0:00:28.76,TL,,0,0,0,,世界第{\fs78}204{\fs68} 来到上海时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:31.13,TL,,0,0,0,,还排在资格赛第九候补
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:33.16,TL,,0,0,0,,开赛前不到{\fs78}36{\fs68}小时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:35.59,TL,,0,0,0,,他才等到参赛席位
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.41,0:00:38.84,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到位置 还要守住
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.84,0:00:41.55,TL,,0,0,0,,资格赛第一轮 先输抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.55,0:00:44.95,TL,,0,0,0,,他连追两盘 赢下巴萨瓦雷迪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.71,0:00:47.98,TL,,0,0,0,,第二轮 又先丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:50.27,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘抢七 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:52.71,TL,,0,0,0,,他离淘汰 只差两分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.71,0:00:54.09,TL,,0,0,0,,迎着对手的发球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.09,0:00:55.54,TL,,0,0,0,,他打出对角制胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.54,0:00:57.87,TL,,0,0,0,,再靠发球拿下这一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.87,0:01:01.31,TL,,0,0,0,,第三盘也追回来 终于走进正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.11,0:01:05.21,TL,,0,0,0,,从这里开始 你会发现 落后一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.35,TL,,0,0,0,,成了他这一路反复遇见的关口
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.11,0:01:10.70,TL,,0,0,0,,首轮赢杰雷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.70,0:01:13.21,TL,,0,0,0,,第二轮 逆转布勃利克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.21,0:01:16.23,TL,,0,0,0,,第三轮 马哈奇在第二盘退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.23,0:01:18.81,TL,,0,0,0,,他已经走到第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.61,0:01:22.65,TL,,0,0,0,,对格里克斯普尔 又先丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.65,0:01:26.13,TL,,0,0,0,,他赢下第二盘抢七 再拿下决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.13,0:01:28.89,TL,,0,0,0,,打了两个多小时 世界第{\fs78}204{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.89,0:01:31.80,TL,,0,0,0,,站进了大师赛{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.61,0:01:34.99,TL,,0,0,0,,对鲁内 首盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.99,0:01:37.08,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘抢七追回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.08,0:01:38.65,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘最后一局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.65,0:01:41.13,TL,,0,0,0,,他还要救下两个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.93,0:01:51.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set and match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.91,0:01:53.39,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The man from Monaco{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N来自摩纳哥的他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.39,0:01:58.11,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}makes more Masters history.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N再创大师赛历史
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.23,0:02:00.96,TL,,0,0,0,,赢下鲁内后 他在镜头上写下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:02.57,TL,,0,0,0,,世界前{\fs78}100{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.57,0:02:04.43,TL,,0,0,0,,去年只差{\fs78}30{\fs68}个积分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.43,0:02:06.60,TL,,0,0,0,,却被伤病挡住的那一步
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:09.44,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 终于跨过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.23,0:02:11.03,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.03,0:02:14.27,TL,,0,0,0,,对面是{\fs78}4{\fs68}次上海冠军德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.27,0:02:16.45,TL,,0,0,0,,德约接受过腰背治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.45,0:02:19.19,TL,,0,0,0,,可最后一局 瓦舍罗救下破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.19,0:02:21.57,TL,,0,0,0,,才收下{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:23.21,TL,,0,0,0,,走进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.07,0:02:29.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set and match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.73,0:02:31.39,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Valentin Vacherot{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦舍罗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.39,0:02:33.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}scripts another chapter{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N续写新篇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.45,0:02:36.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in the story of the tennis season.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N为这个网球赛季再添传奇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.43,0:02:42.51,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛 对面站着表哥林德克内希
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.51,0:02:44.49,TL,,0,0,0,,他们曾是大学队友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.49,0:02:45.57,TL,,0,0,0,,无论谁赢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.57,0:02:48.67,TL,,0,0,0,,这个家都会有一个大师赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.43,0:02:51.73,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘 表哥抢前点击球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.73,0:02:53.59,TL,,0,0,0,,压缩他的反应时间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:55.78,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 又落后了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.78,0:02:56.93,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.93,0:02:58.98,TL,,0,0,0,,瓦舍罗把表哥压在底线后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.98,0:03:01.27,TL,,0,0,0,,第八局拿下对手发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.27,0:03:03.44,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 追回一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.44,0:03:06.59,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘第一局 他又抢下表哥发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.59,0:03:08.33,TL,,0,0,0,,把领先守到终点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.33,0:03:10.91,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一分 交给现场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.08,0:03:20.85,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set and match, Vacherot.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束 瓦舍罗获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:22.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Two sets to one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N大比分二比一
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.23,0:03:23.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Valentin Vacherot{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦舍罗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.95,0:03:27.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}puts the icing on the cake{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N画上圆满句号
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.13,0:03:30.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to a fairy tale week in Shanghai.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N为这段上海童话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.69,0:03:37.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's just unreal what just happened.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N刚刚发生的一切 太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.03,0:03:39.47,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}场全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.47,0:03:42.73,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}次先丢首盘 {\fs78}6{\fs68}次赢下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.73,0:03:44.99,TL,,0,0,0,,我们记住了奖杯 也别忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.99,0:03:47.44,TL,,0,0,0,,那些差点结束的关口
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.23,0:03:51.59,TL,,0,0,0,,奖杯之后 日子 仍有起伏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.43,0:03:53.98,TL,,0,0,0,,巴黎{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:55.87,TL,,0,0,0,,年末世界第{\fs78}31{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.87,0:03:58.51,TL,,0,0,0,,第二年 蒙特卡洛半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.51,0:04:00.72,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 他在自己的主场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:03.13,TL,,0,0,0,,站进了世界前{\fs78}20{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:06.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The semi-finals are calling.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N半决赛 正在向他招手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.73,0:04:10.45,TL,,0,0,0,,但{\fs78}5{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.45,0:04:13.78,TL,,0,0,0,,左脚伤让他在法网第二轮赛前退出
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:15.87,TL,,0,0,0,,随后 退出温网
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.87,0:04:19.64,TL,,0,0,0,,近两个月之后 他才在格施塔德复出
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.43,0:04:22.55,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月 成都头号种子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.55,0:04:25.35,TL,,0,0,0,,首战就输给资格赛球员哈里斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.35,0:04:27.80,TL,,0,0,0,,随后东京 他逆转西西帕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:30.53,TL,,0,0,0,,赢下菲斯 又打进了半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.53,0:04:33.03,TL,,0,0,0,,输过 也继续赢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.99,0:04:43.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a big turnaround for{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是一次漂亮的逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:44.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Valentin Vacherot.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N来自瓦舍罗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.93,0:04:45.69,TL,,0,0,0,,一年后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.69,0:04:48.89,TL,,0,0,0,,他以{\fs78}17{\fs68}号种子的身份回到上海
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:50.53,TL,,0,0,0,,不用再等一个位置
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.53,0:04:53.31,TL,,0,0,0,,比赛 仍要一场场打
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.13,0:04:56.91,TL,,0,0,0,,下一次又落后时 你愿不愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.91,0:04:58.87,TL,,0,0,0,,再给自己一次机会？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.87,0:05:02.27,TL,,0,0,0,,低谷 不能替一个人写下结局
